From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Martin=20=C5=A0trobl?= <recordyletsplays@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 21:20:40 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] ANDROID: arm64: configs: Add a3y17lte_defconfig

Generated by tools/android/mkconfig (a3y17lte tools repo): the mainline
a3y17lte config, plus the Android 17 kernel config requirements
(kernel/configs c/android-6.12) and S-Boot/first-stage needs: no forced
cmdline (S-Boot passes androidboot.*), bootconfig from the ramdisk,
EROFS/f2fs/dm built in, configfs gadget with FunctionFS.

Not set although required by the 6.12 list: ASHMEM (Rust-only in this
tree; Android uses memfd), SCHED_DEBUG and NF_CT_PROTO_DCCP (removed
upstream). CFI_CLANG is CFI here.
